---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <div class="terms-container">
    <div class="terms-content">
      <h1>Delete your LinguaLoop account</h1>

      <div class="intro">
        <p>
          You can permanently delete your LinguaLoop account and all associated
          data at any time. Follow the steps below to request deletion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="quick-links">
        <p><strong>Quick links:</strong></p>
        <p>
          <a href="#delete-in-app">Delete from inside the app</a> ·
          <a href="#delete-by-email">Delete by email</a> ·
          <a href="#what-gets-deleted">What gets deleted</a> ·
          <a href="#what-is-retained">What is retained</a> ·
          <a href="#subscription-cancellation">Subscription cancellation</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr />

      <div class="terms-section" id="delete-in-app">
        <h2>1. Delete from inside the app (preferred)</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Open LinguaLoop on your device.</li>
          <li>Go to <strong>Profile → Settings → Manage account</strong>.</li>
          <li>Tap <strong>"Delete account"</strong>.</li>
          <li>
            Confirm. Your account and all associated data will be permanently
            deleted within <strong>30 days</strong>.
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="delete-by-email">
        <h2>2. Delete by email (alternative)</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            If you can't access the app, send an email to <a
              href="mailto:support@linguatech.app">support@linguatech.app</a
            > from the email address associated with your LinguaLoop account.
          </li>
          <li>Subject: <strong>"Delete my account"</strong>.</li>
          <li>
            We will verify ownership and process the deletion within <strong
              >30 days</strong
            >.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="what-gets-deleted">
        <h2>3. What gets deleted</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            User profile (name, email, native language, target level,
            preferences).
          </li>
          <li>
            Learning progress (completed lessons, exercise history, streaks,
            stats).
          </li>
          <li>
            Saved phrases, chat history, and Speaking session transcripts.
          </li>
          <li>Reminder configuration and notification preferences.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="what-is-retained">
        <h2>4. What is retained</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Anonymized analytics events used for product improvement (cannot be
            linked back to the deleted account).
          </li>
          <li>
            Billing/transaction records required by tax and consumer protection
            law in the user's jurisdiction (retained for the legally mandated
            period, after which they are also deleted).
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="subscription-cancellation">
        <h2>5. Subscription cancellation</h2>
        <p>
          Deleting your account does <strong>NOT</strong> cancel active subscriptions.
          You must cancel your subscription separately through Google Play before
          deleting your account, otherwise you'll continue to be charged.
        </p>
        <p>
          Open the <strong>Google Play</strong> app → <strong>Profile</strong> →
          <strong>Payments &amp; subscriptions</strong> → <strong
            >Subscriptions</strong
          > → <strong>LinguaLoop</strong> → <strong>Cancel subscription</strong
          >.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="terms-section" id="legal-links">
        <h2>Legal Links</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="/lingualoop/terms-of-use">Terms of Service</a> •
          <a href="/lingualoop/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> •
          <a href="/lingualoop/support">Support</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .terms-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .terms-content {
    text-align: left;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .intro {
    background: #f8fafc;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .quick-links {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .quick-links p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .quick-links strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  hr {
    border: none;
    border-top: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .terms-section {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }

  .terms-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .terms-section ul {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section ol {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .terms-section strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .terms-section em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  a {
    color: #3b82f6;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .terms-container {
      margin: 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .terms-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .terms-section h3 {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
